Features:	PAGE6
The Project Takes the following inputs from the User:-
1.	Age: The age of the user.
2.	Gender: The gender of the user (e.g., Male, Female, Non-binary).
3.	Platform: The social media platform(s) used by the user (e.g., Facebook, Twitter, Instagram).
4.	Daily_Usage_Time (minutes): The total time spent on social media per day in minutes.
5.	Posts_Per_Day: The number of posts made by the user per day.
6.	Likes_Received_Per_Day: The number of likes received by the user per day.
7.	Comments_Received_Per_Day: The number of comments received by the user per day.
8.	Messages_Sent_Per_Day: The number of messages sent by the user per day.
Target Output:
The project generates one of the output from the outputs given below
•	Emotional State: The predicted emotional state of the user, categorized into one of the following emotions:
o	Anger
o	Anxiety
o	Boredom
o	Happiness
o	Neutral
o	Sadness

